# `yo fix <path> --migrate deref` run twice (decision 43 step 2 N1e-1): the
# first run appends `.*` to the bare `n`, and to the `b.*` that read the Box's
# payload the old way (`b.*.*`); the second run reads both the new way and
# applies nothing, and the expected_tree pins the once-migrated main.yo.
stdout_keep=^fix:
timeout=240
